.TH GETHOSTNAME 2N UniSoft
.SH NAME
gethostname \- get name of current host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B char hostname[32];
.sp
.B gethostname(hostname, sizeof (hostname));
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Gethostname\^
returns the standard host name for the current processor, as set by
.IR sethostname\^ (2)
and defined in
.IR rhost\^ (3).
The name is null-terminated.
.SH SEE ALSO
sethostname(2N), rhost(3N).
.\"N	 @(#)gethostname.2N	 5.2 of 7/12/84
